# OPEN HOUSE: Party House caps fame at 65 ([V]) and cash at $30 ([S]). Pay
# past a cap is lost: at the end of a party (income first, then the guests
# who charge), for the paparazzo and usher, and in the tally's count. The
# top bar says MAX. The upstart is worth 9 at most, a tailor's +1s too.
game openhouse
wait 5
cheat new 1 1
cheat pop 60
cheat cash 28
cheat give 19 2
cheat give 20 2
cheat door 19 19 20 20
expect n == 4
expect trouble == 0
cheat end
expect pop == 65
expect cash == 28
expect end_pop == 8
expect end_cash == 0
hold A
waituntil tally == 3 400
release A
expect tallypop == 65
expect tallycash == 28
# at the cap already: fame and cash stay put, with nothing lost
cheat next
cheat leave
wait 2
cheat pop 65
cheat cash 30
cheat give 34 1
cheat door 34
cheat end
expect pop == 65
expect cash == 30
# the paparazzo's pay now stops at the cap as well
cheat next
cheat leave
wait 2
cheat pop 3
cheat cash 29
cheat give 18 1
cheat give 35 1
cheat door 18 35
cheat act 0 1
expect cash == 30
expect got_cash == 1
# OPEN ALL NIGHT keeps the caps
cheat new 7 1
cheat pop 64
cheat cash 29
cheat give 19 1
cheat give 20 1
cheat door 19 20
cheat end
expect pop == 65
expect cash == 29
expect top_pop == 65
# the upstart: 7 visits and two tailor's +1s would be 10; it's 9
cheat new 2 1
cheat give 26 1
cheat card 26 7 2
cheat door 26
expect vpop0 == 9
